  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 790 + 5 ÷ 58 × 5 - 96 = 352 \n\nNow, by replacing the * signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : =, −, +, ÷, + \n\n45 * 15 * 13 * 52 * 26 * 37 ⇒ 45 = 15 - 13 + **52 ÷ 26**__ + 37 \n\n45 = __**15 + 2 + 37**__ - 13\n\n45 = __**54 - 13**__\n\n45 ≠ 41 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n <li&g",
